        "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>If RC Wraith was just Discard it or put it back on top of the Environment deck</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I like that.  I’m going to change her rules on the oversized hero cards I use to be that, because that does sound much more fun.</p>",
