        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-17T04:22:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also consider the case of playing alongside Visionary, you can put the worst card to the top of the deck and then discard it, ensuring it never comes up, not just moving it down the stack.</p>",
