      {
        "id": 30527,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-17T05:52:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought the point was to compare the base power to the base power, not to compare the base power to any possible power that might or might not come out in a game. Almost every base power loses out to every other power in a given deck.</p>",
